note exit trap6: the program owns an 8 MiB stack with its floor in X28. Each level takes a 1 MiB
note local array and prints its depth (a firmware call on that stack): levels 1..7 fit, the eighth
note does not, and the stack check returns 2^63 | 106 (0000006A) to the firmware.
fn down d ulong to ulong
a = new uchar 1048576 0
put a 0 uchar d
hx add d ulong get a 1048575
ret add 1 down add d 1
end

fn main to ulong
mark 66
hx down 1
mark 69
ret 0
end
